Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.25,0:00:03.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,一句話，讓 AI 幫你做短影音。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.25,0:00:03.30,EN,,0,0,0,,One prompt. One short video.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.40,CardId,,0,0,0,,S1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.40,Card,,0,0,0,,（分鏡示意）\N標題字卡＋成品畫面閃現
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.65,0:00:07.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,先請 Fable 5.2 規劃腳本與分鏡。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.65,0:00:07.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Ask Fable 5.2 to plan the script and storyboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:09.00,CardId,,0,0,0,,S2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:09.00,Card,,0,0,0,,（分鏡示意）\N示意終端機：輸入需求，Fable 5.2 回覆分鏡表
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.25,0:00:14.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,它會寫 Unity 腳本，自動建場景、排動畫。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.25,0:00:14.30,EN,,0,0,0,,It writes Unity scripts to build scenes and animation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:17.00,CardId,,0,0,0,,S3
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:17.00,Card,,0,0,0,,（分鏡示意）\NUnity 場景自動生成：物件逐一出現、鏡頭環繞
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.25,0:00:21.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,直式輸出，再合成旁白與雙語字幕。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.25,0:00:21.66,EN,,0,0,0,,Render vertical, then add voice-over and bilingual subtitles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:23.00,CardId,,0,0,0,,S4
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:23.00,Card,,0,0,0,,（分鏡示意）\N直式畫框輸出，聲波與字幕條疊上
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.25,0:00:27.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,打開 Reels，上傳、選音樂、發布。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.25,0:00:27.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Open Reels: upload, pick music, publish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:28.00,CardId,,0,0,0,,S5
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:28.00,Card,,0,0,0,,（分鏡示意）\N手機示意畫面：上傳、選音樂、發布，搭配 mtk-viewer 觸控擴散圈
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.25,0:00:29.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,換你試試看。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.25,0:00:29.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.00,CardId,,0,0,0,,S6
